aragon-ai (1.5.25) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed web search (and news/images/videos/page-fetch) going down after a
    routine restart: the search bridge depended on a third-party package
    with no upper version limit, so picking up that package's latest
    release could silently break it. It's now pinned to a known-good range,
    and a separate port mix-up that could only surface once that crash was
    fixed is also corrected.

